<!doctype html><html><body><template><style>#root{position:absolute;inset:0;color:#f8fafc;font-family:Avenir Next,Arial,sans-serif;pointer-events:none}.cue{position:absolute;left:78px;bottom:235px;width:924px;padding:19px 25px 21px;border-radius:22px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.92);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.3);font-size:45px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;text-align:center;letter-spacing:-1px;opacity:0}.cue span{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#D946EF);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}</style><div id="root" data-composition-id="captions-es" data-duration="20.100" data-width="1080" data-height="1920"><div id="c1" class="cue"><span>Publicar más no es la solución.</span></div><div id="c2" class="cue"><span>Tu problema probablemente no es que</span></div><div id="c3" class="cue"><span>publicas poco.</span></div><div id="c4" class="cue"><span>Puedes subir 100 videos con inteligencia</span></div><div id="c5" class="cue"><span>artificial y seguir sin conectar con</span></div><div id="c6" class="cue"><span>nadie.</span></div><div id="c7" class="cue"><span>La IA puede multiplicar tu contenido,</span></div><div id="c8" class="cue"><span>pero primero tienes que tener algo</span></div><div id="c9" class="cue"><span>que valga la pena decir.¿Qué prefieres</span></div><div id="c10" class="cue"><span>seguir?¿Alguien que publica mucho o alguien</span></div><div id="c11" class="cue"><span>que realmente te hace pensar?</span></div></div><script>const tl=gsap.timeline({paused:true});const cues=[["#c1",0,1.75],["#c2",1.75,3.71],["#c3",3.71,4.52],["#c4",4.52,6.96],["#c5",7.17,9.17],["#c6",9.17,9.7],["#c7",9.7,11.76],["#c8",11.76,13.71],["#c9",13.71,15.63],["#c10",15.63,18.03],["#c11",18.03,19.85]];cues.forEach(([id,a,b])=>{tl.fromTo(id,{opacity:0,y:14},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.09,ease:'power1.out'},a).to(id,{opacity:0,y:-8,duration:.09,ease:'power1.in'},Math.max(a,b-.09))});window.__timelines=window.__timelines||{};window.__timelines['captions-es']=tl;</script></template></body></html>